{"1101370": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Wind Runners", "steam_appid": 1101370, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "controller_support": "full", "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1101370/extras/c57b870401f881f301a566f06959d27c.avif?t=1780948912\" width=736 height=69 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1101370/extras/e4e4da3e2fa9331dae3b72c65661b598.poster.avif?t=1780948912\" width=780 height=438 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1101370/extras/e4e4da3e2fa9331dae3b72c65661b598.webm?t=1780948912\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1101370/extras/e4e4da3e2fa9331dae3b72c65661b598.mp4?t=1780948912\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Born from the Zerah Igna star system crushed by oppression, every flight is a defiant stand against overwhelming forces. Engage in high-precision bullet-hell dogfighting: dash and roll through converging fire, unleash your firepower against relentless enemy waves, and face towering, God-like boss battles that push every run to its limit. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1101370/extras/871fe8cfad922170c61a67b9bb726f6f.avif?t=1780948912\" width=750 height=66 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1101370/extras/ee23010daadb76eb1ae84cd4e31d2b92.poster.avif?t=1780948912\" width=780 height=438 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1101370/extras/ee23010daadb76eb1ae84cd4e31d2b92.webm?t=1780948912\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1101370/extras/ee23010daadb76eb1ae84cd4e31d2b92.mp4?t=1780948912\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You are part of a growing resistance fighting the ruthless Realm. Choose one of three Wind Runners, each with a distinct playstyle, and decide where to strike: disrupt enemy supply lines, destroy key fortresses, and free oppressed worlds. Each successful strike weakens the dominion, liberates a world and fuels the uprising! </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1101370/extras/2fb158ce1e04b8b5fd639bffb31fcf57.avif?t=1780948912\" width=730 height=69 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1101370/extras/7d02451c1fe0dd6ccff30f676c43b8c7.poster.avif?t=1780948912\" width=780 height=438 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1101370/extras/7d02451c1fe0dd6ccff30f676c43b8c7.webm?t=1780948912\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1101370/extras/7d02451c1fe0dd6ccff30f676c43b8c7.mp4?t=1780948912\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The Saints rule through fear, each commanding a colossal Cardinal Beast to dominate entire planets. Confront them, learn their patterns, carve through enemy waves, and rely on precise timing and positioning. Each encounter escalates into a massive boss battle where progress comes from flawless execution. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1101370/extras/0a5e6d983e83431f46ec669d398e141f.avif?t=1780948912\" width=741 height=69 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1101370/extras/27d769805290e57158be3d206478f067.poster.avif?t=1780948912\" width=780 height=438 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1101370/extras/27d769805290e57158be3d206478f067.webm?t=1780948912\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1101370/extras/27d769805290e57158be3d206478f067.mp4?t=1780948912\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each run matters, whether you triumph or fall. Breakthroughs let you strike deeper into the Saints’ territory, unlocking new weapons, upgrades, and evolving synergies that reshape your playstyle. When a raid ends, gathered resources permanently upgrade your ship, rally new allies in your Mothership, and empower the resistance, turning defeat into momentum and bringing the resistance closer to victory.</p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1101370/extras/c57b870401f881f301a566f06959d27c.avif?t=1780948912\" width=736 height=69 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1101370/extras/e4e4da3e2fa9331dae3b72c65661b598.poster.avif?t=1780948912\" width=780 height=438 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1101370/extras/e4e4da3e2fa9331dae3b72c65661b598.webm?t=1780948912\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1101370/extras/e4e4da3e2fa9331dae3b72c65661b598.mp4?t=1780948912\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Born from the Zerah Igna star system crushed by oppression, every flight is a defiant stand against overwhelming forces. Engage in high-precision bullet-hell dogfighting: dash and roll through converging fire, unleash your firepower against relentless enemy waves, and face towering, God-like boss battles that push every run to its limit. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1101370/extras/871fe8cfad922170c61a67b9bb726f6f.avif?t=1780948912\" width=750 height=66 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1101370/extras/ee23010daadb76eb1ae84cd4e31d2b92.poster.avif?t=1780948912\" width=780 height=438 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1101370/extras/ee23010daadb76eb1ae84cd4e31d2b92.webm?t=1780948912\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1101370/extras/ee23010daadb76eb1ae84cd4e31d2b92.mp4?t=1780948912\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You are part of a growing resistance fighting the ruthless Realm. Choose one of three Wind Runners, each with a distinct playstyle, and decide where to strike: disrupt enemy supply lines, destroy key fortresses, and free oppressed worlds. Each successful strike weakens the dominion, liberates a world and fuels the uprising! </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1101370/extras/2fb158ce1e04b8b5fd639bffb31fcf57.avif?t=1780948912\" width=730 height=69 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1101370/extras/7d02451c1fe0dd6ccff30f676c43b8c7.poster.avif?t=1780948912\" width=780 height=438 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1101370/extras/7d02451c1fe0dd6ccff30f676c43b8c7.webm?t=1780948912\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1101370/extras/7d02451c1fe0dd6ccff30f676c43b8c7.mp4?t=1780948912\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The Saints rule through fear, each commanding a colossal Cardinal Beast to dominate entire planets. Confront them, learn their patterns, carve through enemy waves, and rely on precise timing and positioning. Each encounter escalates into a massive boss battle where progress comes from flawless execution. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1101370/extras/0a5e6d983e83431f46ec669d398e141f.avif?t=1780948912\" width=741 height=69 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1101370/extras/27d769805290e57158be3d206478f067.poster.avif?t=1780948912\" width=780 height=438 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1101370/extras/27d769805290e57158be3d206478f067.webm?t=1780948912\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"http